# Prospective session labels

Only prospective rows have dim, right-aligned creation labels. Labels overwrite
an overlapping repository path, with a space on either side of the label.

    :bins cat jj

> [!NOTE]
> 'cat', and 'jj' are available.

    :t rename-session -t 0 runner (success)
    :t resize-window -t runner:0 -x 80 -y 14 (success)
    :t respawn-pane -k -t runner:0.0 'smth --no-base --repo-root parent; cat' (success)
    :pane runner:0.0
    :settle -d 2s (settled)
    :k prospective
    :snap --color

```terminal
session: prospective
  0/1 | [C-r] repo: none
   prospective                              ~/p/prospective               repo ┃
▌  prospective                                                            tmux ┃
                                                                               ┃
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────








```

![light](new-session-labels.md.snap.1.light.svg)
![dark](new-session-labels.md.snap.1.dark.svg)

Narrow the picker and select the repository candidate. The dim label should
overwrite the end of its basename, leaving a separating space.

    :t resize-window -t runner:0 -x 65 -y 14 (success)
    :k up
    :snap --color

```terminal
session: prospective
  0/1 | [C-r] repo: none
▌  prospective                              ~/p/prospectiv repo ┃
   prospective                                             tmux ┃
                                                                ┃
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────








```

![light](new-session-labels.md.snap.2.light.svg)
![dark](new-session-labels.md.snap.2.dark.svg)

The label should also take precedence when the row is not selected.

    :k down
    :snap --color

```terminal
session: prospective
  0/1 | [C-r] repo: none
   prospective                              ~/p/prospectiv repo ┃
▌  prospective                                             tmux ┃
                                                                ┃
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────








```

![light](new-session-labels.md.snap.3.light.svg)
![dark](new-session-labels.md.snap.3.dark.svg)

At an even narrower width, the complete label remains visible over the path.

    :t resize-window -t runner:0 -x 52 -y 14 (success)
    :snap --color

```terminal
session: prospective
  0/1 | [C-r] repo: none
   prospective                              ~ repo ┃
▌  prospective                                tmux ┃
                                                   ┃
────────────────────────────────────────────────────








```

![light](new-session-labels.md.snap.4.light.svg)
![dark](new-session-labels.md.snap.4.dark.svg)

Existing sessions do not acquire a creation label.

    :t resize-window -t runner:0 -x 80 -y 14 (success)
    :k C-u runner
    :snap

```terminal
session: runner
  1/1 | [C-r] repo: none | [C-x] close, [C-f] flag
   runner~1                                 ~/p/runner                    repo ┃
   runner~1                                                               tmux ┃
▌⬤ runner                                                                      ┃
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────








```

